message: "If you use TRACE-OS or the TRACE principles in your research, please cite the paper that introduces them, as below."
type: software
title: "TRACE-OS"
abstract: "TRACE-OS is an operating system for AI-assisted research projects: the shared environment in which researchers direct the work and AI agents carry it out and record it, putting the five TRACE principles into practice."
